# Copy to .npmrc (do not commit secrets) or set in CI.
#
# Public npm (registry.npmjs.org): run `npm login`, then `npm run publish:ng-bpmn`.
# No .npmrc is required unless you use a custom registry or automation token.
#
# Private registry — replace REGISTRY_HOST and set NPM_TOKEN:

@denizz311:registry=https://REGISTRY_HOST/
//REGISTRY_HOST/:_authToken=${NPM_TOKEN}
always-auth=true
